nclude Time Attack, Stunt and Challenges across five different environments, and bike and rider customization lets players tune a setup for speed or for style.\n\nGhost Mode allows racing against other riders' recorded runs, and over 140 online leaderboards keep score comparisons going. Physics-driven handling rewards practice, and the retry-and-improve loop is the heart of the game. It is single-player with full controller support, and it suits players who enjoy trials games and chasing a cleaner, faster run."}}